// ================================================================== item swap (Trick, Switcheroo...)
// The GBA drops two item bags between the battlers, swirls them round each other, shakes both battlers as they
// receive (SE_M_ATTRACT) and blinks the bags out. v3 draws each bag as a lit cloth pouch carried by the move's energy
// and makes the exchange readable without changing its timing: each pouch rises out of its holder, joins the
// runtime's orbit (drawn as a glowing ring), leaves it in the last half second and lands in the other battler on the
// frame the runtime shakes the receivers. The pouch is a generic held-item silhouette: the Lab does not know the
