/* ==== src/hd/v3_f.js ==== */
/* Battle FX Lab — HD layer, v3 move work, group F: the 83 battle animations (status conditions, stat changes, weather, balls, switching, Mega / Primal / Z / Dynamax / Tera, form changes)
   Loaded after v3.js (configs and kits here override earlier files). See docs/V3_AUTHORING.md.
   Everything here only draws: the converted scripts and the ported C still decide what moves where and when; effects
   start on the scripts' own events (tasks, templates, background commands) or follow the runtime's sprites. New names
   carry the group prefix f_ (kits, FX kinds, MOVE_FX kinds, ramps, cells). */
