// ================================================================== Wood Hammer: a leaping overhead slam; the target pops back into shape
// v3_b's bark glow, whirling leaves, slam, splinters and recoil stay. Added: the user's rush becomes a leap that comes down
// onto the target (a hammer blow from above), a timber impact (leaves and wood chips, no white core), and the target's
